=2 Walkthrough
* Speak with {n:Ailbeche}.
* Talk to {p:Exoroche} at Helbort's Blades in {z:Southern San d'Oria} (K-7).
* Return to and speak with {n:Ailbeche} again.
* Trade {n:Ailbeche} a {@i:Giant Shell Bug|17001} {p:Giant Shell Bug}.
** Either buy one off the Auction House, or go to {z:Crawler's Nest} and defeat {m:Dreadbug} via the **???** on {z:map 2, SW of H-9|Crawler's Nest}.
** He can drop up to 4 {@i:Giant Shell Bug|17001} {p:Giant Shell Bug}.
** If you are planning to complete this quest for other characters on the same account in one trip, you may pop {m:Dreadbug} again, __only while this quest is still active__, on subsequent new game days, once per game day.
** **Note:** Be careful to do the above NPC interactions, as if skipped you will use up the {@i:Giant Shell Bug|17001} {p:Giant Shell Bug} you get during the next step.
* Fish with {p:a rod used for catching big fish|Fishing} in {z:Castle Oztroja} using {@i:Giant Shell Bug|17001} {p:Giant Shell Bug} as bait. Fishing skill is not required.
** __You will want to bring more than one Giant Shell Bug.__
** A {@i:Clothespole|17383} {i:Clothespole|Clothespole|17383} from the Fishing Guild Merchant or {@i:Comp. Fishing Rod|17381} {i:Composite Fishing Rod|Composite Fishing Rod|17381} from the Auction House are likely the easiest to obtain.
*** However, even a rod not designed for large fish, such as a {@i:Willow Fish. Rod|17391} {i:Willow Fishing Rod|Willow Fishing Rod|17391} may be successfully used.
* From the entrance, go through the Brass Door at (I-8) on Map 1. Be careful about the trapdoor, you can avoid falling down by quickly moving after triggering the lever if you select the wrong one.
** On Map 2, walk towards exit (F) at (G-7).
** On the next map, head to (I). You will then be on map 7.
** On map 7 head towards (H-8)/(H-9) (middle of the big square room in the middle of Map 7) and fish in the pond. There are 2 {m:Oozes|Ooze} in the pond.

!Castle Oztroja-map1.jpg||Castle Oztroja Map 1
!Castle Oztroja-map2.jpg||Castle Oztroja Map 2
!Castle Oztroja-map7.jpg||Castle Oztroja Map 7
* {m:Odontotyrannus (Monster)} will be fished up and drops {@i:Odontotyrannus|4562} {i:Odontotyrannus|Odontotyrannus|4562}. Note that the fish can be sent to other characters on the same account.
** {m:Odontotyrannus (Monster)} may be immediately fished up again after defeat if needing multiple {@i:Odontotyrannus|4562} {i:Odontotyrannus|Odontotyrannus|4562} for other players.
** You can fish up {m:Odontotyrannus (Monster)} before trading {n:Ailbeche} the {p:Giant Shell Bug} in the previous step.
* Return {n:Ailbeche} and trade them the {@i:Odontotyrannus|4562} {i:Odontotyrannus|Odontotyrannus|4562}.
* Head to {z:Selbina} and trade Trade {n:Zaldon} (H-9), (inside the Fisherman's Guild) the {@i:Odontotyrannus|4562} {i:Odontotyrannus|Odontotyrannus|4562} and receive the {@k} {k:Knight's boots}.
* Return to and speak with {n:Ailbeche} again.
* Speak with {p:Exoroche} at Helbort's Blades in {z:Southern San d'Oria} (K-7) one last time.
* Finally, head to {z:Chateau d'Oraguille} and select Trion's door (Prince Royal's Rm, H-7) to receive your {@i:Gallant Leggings|14095} {i:Gallant Leggings|Gallant Leggings|14095}.

